Package: AnalysisSurvival
Type: Package
Title: Automated Survival Analysis, Kaplan-Meier Plotting, and Cox Modeling
Version: 0.4.0
Date: 2026-07-31
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pau", "Berenguer-Molins", 
           email = "pberenguer@researchmar.net", 
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("MarData Bioinformatics Unit", 
           email = "mardata-bu@researchmar.net", 
           role = "cph")
  )
Description: Standardized workflow for clinical survival analysis. Computes Kaplan-Meier 
    estimates, log-rank tests, and univariate or multivariable Cox proportional hazards 
    models. Automatically extracts median survival times with confidence intervals, 
    evaluates proportional hazards assumptions via Schoenfeld residuals, tests for 
    interaction terms, and outputs publication-ready KM curve figures.
